OL,3,GNEWSASea dip goes ahead after pollution
OL,4,Awarning lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bi-annual community sea dip event
OL,7,Fwhich celebrates the water has gone
OL,8,Fahead despite a recent environmental
OL,9,Fspill.
OL,11,FThe Big Dip community swim in Exmouth,
OL,12,FDevon, takes place at the start and end
OL,13,Fof the bathing season. Organisers said
OL,14,Fit was "more important than ever" to
OL,15,Fcelebrate the coastline after the sea
OL,16,Fwas closed at the beach for 111 days in
OL,17,F2025 due to sewage pollution.
OL,19,FThe Environment Agency had urged people
OL,20,Fto avoid bathing at the beach following
OL,21,Fa recent incident but that warning was
OL,22,Flifted on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
