OL,3,GNEWSASea dip goes ahead after pollution
OL,4,Awarning lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt later confirmed that it was linked
OL,7,Fto a chemical spill from a premises in
OL,8,FExmouth and was not sewage pollution.
